WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.103
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.010
- You can't really teach
someone to be a lowrider,

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.293
you just live and breathe it.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:17.930
A lot of people associate
lowriders with the car hoppers,

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.770
which is what you see
on TV, or at a car show;

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:24.460
you know, all these cars
who get high off the ground.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.380
And there's the cars like mine,

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.030
we just cruise low to the ground.

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:30.903
I like to cruise low and slow.

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:42.880
My name is Ruby Ramirez, and
I'm also known as "Chingona."

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:45.270
I'm a part of the Califas Car Club

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.520
and the San Francisco Lowrider Council.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.370
I'm just a girl who loves to lowride.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.480
A lot of people get really surprised,

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:54.380
like, this is your car?

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.720
People think the car is my husband's.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.680
No, it's my car.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:02.880
I wanted my car to say,
I'm a badass bitch.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.370
Chingona means badass bitch.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.313
So, my car is a 1950 Chevy Fleetline.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:12.043
Originally, it was all
blue, it just wasn't me.

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:16.600
I just drew what I wanted down on paper,

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:18.590
and laid down some patterns,

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:21.750
and with everyone's help we got my vision

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.900
from paper to the streets.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.053
And, now it's cruising everywhere.

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:31.820
In the lowrider community
there are very few women.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:35.903
There's clubs that don't
allow females, and it sucks.

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:39.730
There's some female car clubs out there.

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:42.300
I, myself, don't wanna be
in a all female car club,

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:46.620
because I wanna show that we
can be with the big boys, too.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.110
We shouldn't separate ourselves

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:50.190
because we're already separated.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:54.420
They have categories that
are female only, and, why?

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.490
Why can't we be right there with the guys?

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:58.240
Why can't we compete with the guys?

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:06.760
(upbeat music)

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.700
I've heard a lot of people,
oh, you know I've seen you,

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:11.673
and you're an inspiration,
so that's pretty cool.

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:15.180
I wish every woman
could get behind a wheel

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:17.163
and experience cruising a lowrider.

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:21.620
There's a lot of women out
there that wanna be a part

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:23.660
of this, and either they don't know how,

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.500
or they just don't have
someone to give 'em a kick.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.940
So, hopefully, they see me,
and we can continue to bring

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:32.073
this into the future.

00:02:33.818 --> 00:02:36.401
(upbeat music)

